rmat=<value>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `<value>` can be:\r\n* `YAML`\r\n* `JSON`\r\n\r\nSee: https://github.com/eclipse/microprofile-open-api/blob/1.x/spec/src/main/asciidoc/microprofile-openapi-spec.adoc#53-query-parameters\r\n\r\n—\r\n\r\nThe current implementation checks for following values:\r\n\r\n* `application/yaml`\r\n* `application/json`\r\n\r\nThose are the values expected for the `Accept` header (that can also be used to control the format of the generated OpenAPI)","closed_by":{"login":"emmanuelbernard","id":300760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMDc2MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/300760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard","html_url":"https://github.com/emmanuelbernard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmanuelbernard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/2967/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/2967/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}